{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race for the Arctic is a travel adventure inside the journal of the Diplomat. On her voyage through the Arctic Circle she meets a series of unique characters, each of whom is racing in their own way to ensure the survival of the Arctic, just as the Diplomat is racing to tell their stories before it is too late. Set in a variety of real-world locations in the Arctic, the game characters are directly inspired by real people and communities who live and work in the Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pop-up book you explore to find pieces of the Diplomat's story. You follow routes, collect momentos, and look for key locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras/dd7c426c83031a032c88260998b09c82.avif?t=1762459074\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras_big/dd7c426c83031a032c88260998b09c82.webp?t=1762459074 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different real locations in the Arctic that you open as dioramas and complete to move the story forward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras/e60747dc4ad7715f447d87eb8d623e67.poster.avif?t=1762459074\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras/e60747dc4ad7715f447d87eb8d623e67.webm?t=1762459074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras/e60747dc4ad7715f447d87eb8d623e67.mp4?t=1762459074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of puzzles unique to every diorama and story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras/c68f49500e45aa41b67b74d2a72ce4c5.avif?t=1762459074\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras_big/c68f49500e45aa41b67b74d2a72ce4c5.avif?t=1762459074 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of unique characters inspired by and co-created with people who live and work in the Arctic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras/b3c5cbe933f53332e2c53f7fbee83716.avif?t=1762459074\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/extras_big/b3c5cbe933f53332e2c53f7fbee83716.webp?t=1762459074 width=1560 height=494 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133060?t=1762459074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133060?t=1762459074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/a16931f13d45e9697dcc9d8c34f5a3ead3d79b2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762459074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133060/a16931f13d45e9697dcc9d8c34f5a3ead3d79b2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762459074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"i